  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝，謝謝你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這裡不安全，快離開吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "離開......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們......又能去哪裡呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們把這裡當成家......現在，什麼都毀了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們......沒有錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有錯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "自稱感染者救星的整合運動居然會攻擊感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "形象......是不是崩塌了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "但所謂整合運動的滲透，絕對不是自發的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "龍門一定有不少感染者，已經追隨了整合運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唉，寧可相信整合運動也不相信羅德島——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "羅德島從來不開空頭支票。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "整合運動給感染者的，哪怕只是些幻覺，都沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "感染者連幻覺都很難看得到啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "即使是幻覺，大多數感染者也會不顧一切，伸手去抓那虛無縹緲的救命稻草吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "又有誰會選擇相信，從不忍心欺騙別人的小兔子呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......我相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "米莎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "小心！你還不能隨便走動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "是有點頭昏......沒關係的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "整合運動......還會追上來吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "我不清楚他們的目的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "我們......走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那我們就立刻動身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "很快，我們就能離開貧民區，與龍門近衛局會合了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "謝謝你，米莎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "該我......感謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
